            <title>[MAHOUT-805] Mahout script sets HADOOP_CONF_DIR to $HADOOP_HOME/src/conf instead of $HADOOP_HOME/conf </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-805</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When the HADOOP_CONF_DIR is not set, the Mahout scripts sets this environment variable to $HADOOP_HOME/src/conf&lt;br/&gt;
instead of $HADOOP_HOME/conf, which is the default location for Hadoop configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
